WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.457
The project asks you to design a small analytics layer for three needs.

00:00:04.457 --> 00:00:09.362
Employee performance is stable shared logic and fits a standard view.

00:00:09.362 --> 00:00:15.517
Recent customer activity can be a shared view, while the at-risk threshold remains in a CTE because it may

00:00:15.517 --> 00:00:17.827
vary by report.

00:00:17.827 --> 00:00:25.477
The diagnosis dashboard uses a repeated summary and can use a materialized view when a refresh delay is

00:00:25.477 --> 00:00:29.252
acceptable. Choose the smallest reusable object that matches the need.

00:00:29.252 --> 00:00:36.002
A CTE is local to one query, a view centralizes live logic, and a materialized view persists a snapshot.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:41.942
Promote logic into shared objects when it is stable, reused, and worth governing as part of the analytical

00:00:41.942 --> 00:00:43.510
architecture.
